tool_messages.edit_unchanged:
Working file unchanged: ${name}
Replacement is byte-identical to the original -- no write
performed. Pick a different edit that actually changes the file.

tool_messages.edit_list_item_failed:
REJECTED: edit ${index} of ${count} failed, so ${none_applied}
(a list applies all or nothing). Its error:

${reason}

tool_messages.edit_list_gate_failed:
REJECTED: the result of ${result_of} fails a check, so ${none_applied}
(the checks run once, on the final result). The check's error:

${reason}

tool_messages.edit_list_unchanged:
Working file unchanged: ${name}
Together the ${count} edits leave it byte-identical -- no write
performed. Pick edits that actually change the file.

